[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000200_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000200_03_0010","text":"嗯——\n风好大啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000200_03_0020","text":"雨好像也要下了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000200_03_0030","text":"那个\n很糟糕吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000200_03_0040","text":"虽然还要跟工作人员商量，\n但如果风雨太大的话，只能中止演唱会了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000200_03_0050","text":"这样啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000200_03_0060","text":"……但是，感觉能飞起来\n现在的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000200_03_0070","text":"……\n像鸟一样，或者像风筝那样吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000200_03_0080","text":"没事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000200_03_0090","text":"飞向蓝天"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000200_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000200_03_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000200_03_0100","text":"看着吧\n制作人"}]
